# Module: raydiansyah.com repository ignore rules
# Purpose: Keep dependencies, builds, local environment, and browser artifacts out of Git
# Used by: Git working tree
# Dependencies: None
# Public functions: None
# Side effects: Excludes generated/local files from version control only
